+{
+  "file": "src/agents.ts",
+  "snippet": "maxTurns: 0,",
+  "cause": "The triage agent is configured with maxTurns: 0, so the generate loop rejects its first tool call (the delegation to orderAgent) with 'Exceeded maximum tool call iterations (0)', while plain replies with no tool call still succeed.",
+  "evidence": "Before the fix, triage.chat().send('hello') returned a reply but triage.chat().send('Where is order A-1001?') failed with 'ABORTED: Exceeded maximum tool call iterations (0)', while orderAgent answered the same question directly; after changing maxTurns to 4 the triage order question returns the correct A-1001 status, ETA and tracking code and tsc passes. The loop check in node_modules/@genkit-ai/ai/lib/generate/action.js (currentTurn + 1 > maxIterations) produces this error."
+}
